  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agricultural Data Collection and Utilization System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Agriculture, Irrigation and Livestock (MAIL) data collection and utilization system project is designed to work with leadership in MAIL to define a set critical provincial level data that can be used as benchmarks for the agriculture sector and provide information to inform MAIL policy. The MAIL Agricultural Data Collection and Utilization System Project (ADCUS) will work with the appropriate MAIL departments to develop and implement a plan for collecting and analyzing the data, and developing data products to inform MAIL leadership. The project will be designed to work with MAIL to identify critical data needs and to work with appropriate MAIL staff to develop capacity develop and implement provincial level data collection.</narrative>
  </description>
